receded by noun 1Chr 5:21 . 4 ׳ח after other number, and a. this after noun 1Chr 8:40 ; Ezra 8:3 , 26 . b. noun repeated e.g. Gen 9:28-29 ,. 5 ׳ח preceded by construct e.g. ח ׳בִּשְׁנַת שָׁנָה 2Kin 15:23 , 27 ; Lev 15:10-11 ,. 6 ׳ח = ordinal, fiftieth Lev 25:10-11 , 2Kin 15:23 , compare 15:27 .","rootNote":"multiple of 2568 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 5 21","keyReferences":["1Chr 5 21","1Chr 5 21","1Chr 8 40","1Chr 9 9","1Chr 12 34","1Kgs 1 5","1Kgs 7 2","1Kgs 7 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":163,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 5 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמִשִּׁ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/חֲמִשִּׁים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 8 40","book":"1Chr","chapter":8,"verse":40,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/חֲמִשִּׁ֑ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 9","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/חֲמִשִּׁ֣ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 34","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמִשִּׁ֣ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 5","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/חֲמִשִּׁ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acbpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 2","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/חֲמִשִּׁ֤ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acbpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 6","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמִשִּׁ֤ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 9 23","book":"1Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמִשִּׁ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 10 29","book":"1Kgs","chapter":10,"v